                                "example_id": "7b9680c2-1976-4969-9a04-a0f32ed8e389",
                                "sense_id": "941c4641-11b0-3288-8d8e-fb26ea5840e7",
                                "text": "Max Chafkin, Thiel's biographer, describes Vance as his \"extension\", while Cadwalladr describes Vance, somewhat impolitely, as \"Thiel's creature… a man Thiel moulded in his own image through lavish investments in his business and political careers\"."
